<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">synaptic-overload</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Synaptic Overload</ansi> spell floods the target's entire nervous system
with overwhelming psionic force, dealing devastating damage through
sheer mental assault. Among the most powerful single-target mental
attacks, it demands both preparation and conviction to unleash.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast synaptic-overload [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 16
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 120
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — willpower and mental fortitude resist the flood
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Devastating psionic damage to a single target

